translation:
The poor fellow thought to enter the temple of fame;
He is glad he got into the hospital too!
He read to everyone his childish ravings—

text:
Начал метаться тревожно;
Мы посидели, пока он уснул,
И разошлись осторожно...

translation:
Began to toss restlessly;
We sat a while until he fell asleep,
And quietly went our separate ways...
